# Paths the pre-publish scanner (git-hooks/scan.sh) skips.
# One path per line, exactly as git lists it. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Every entry says why it is here.

# Built-in style profiles describe the Teams preset as a chat with colleagues.
# legacy_v0_profiles() is frozen: its strings must match old saved settings
# byte for byte, so the wording cannot be changed to satisfy the scanner.
src-tauri/src/style.rs

# Generates the third-party license notices, so it writes notice lines by design.
scripts/third-party-notices.mjs

# Holds the app's own copyright notice inside a JSON string. The scanner only
# accepts the owner's notice when the line ends right after the name.
src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
